        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7505, Brushed Stainless Steel Oval Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary Oval Stainless Steel Cup Pull from Omnia has a brushed finish that can be resistant to smudges, scratches, and abrasions, making it ideal for high-traffic areas. This pull is pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws), and the inside grab area has a soft edge lip making it easier to grasp. The Brushed Stainless Steel Oval Cup Pull is most often used on sliding doors such as barn doors and sliding pocket doors, but it also can be used on lightweight drawers and doors like those found on furniture or kitchen cabinets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Omnia <a href=\"/products/loft-stainless-steel-cup-pull-omnia-7506\"><b>Loft Stainless Steel Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7505 Stainless Oval Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: .050\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Height: 3-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7505-template.pdf?v=1704262252\"><b>Omnia 7505 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
